Codex 的项目级配置写在：

`.codex/hooks.json`

```json
{
  "description": "保护 profile 个人资料目录，只允许读取",
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash|Edit|Write",
        "hooks": [
